          "name": "Create a user ID",
          "request": {
            "name": "Create a user ID",
            "description": {
              "content": "This endpoint generates a new user ID that can be used to identify a user within Permutive.\n\n When you're not using an SDK, and you're interacting with this endpoint directly, it is your responsibility to store a user's ID. This endpoint responds with a Permtive user ID that can be used to identify a user within Permutive, to be stored by the client.",
